# English artifacts

Discussion with the user may be in Chinese. Everything written into the repository must be English:

- README files, `docs/`, comments, docstrings, CLI help, plot titles/labels/legends, commit messages, and slide text
- Notation in code uses the English names already in the project: death, lock / locking, drift, plateau, rotation number \(\rho\), natural frequency \(\omega\), lock center \(c\), noise \(\sigma\)

Do not add Chinese comments, section headings, or figure annotations to tracked files.
